  "notes": ["These are follow-up visits of the original normal replacement actor under declared scene state 4, cut before presentation and followed by the original registry rebuild.","The source Nurse HP caller heals a declared 110 HP inlet to 160, requests the type-21 effect, then writes the role mask. No kind-2 cell is provided; the admitted effect lifecycle is outside this receipt.","On the ordinary guard's positive-to-zero edge the original body prepass clears the role mask. The guard uses raw +0x1DCC, not the secondary rate slowed by the separate 15-visit pose timer.","Zeroing the guard ahead of the prepass bypasses that edge. An already-zero guard leaves the Nurse mask set in the tested neutral window; the one-unit declared control restores the edge without changing the pose timer.","Fresh B forks reach the original paid factory while the role mask is still closed, but are discarded before allocation. No continuing battle input, effect admission, hardware or native gameplay is qualified."],
